{"1":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed, We"},{"c":"أَعْطَيْنَاكَ","d":"aʿṭaynāka","e":"have given you"},{"c":"الْكَوْثَرَ","d":"l-kawthara","e":"Al-Kauthar"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muhammad], al-Kawthar."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"فَصَلِّ","d":"faṣalli","e":"So pray"},{"c":"لِرَبِّكَ","d":"lirabbika","e":"to your Lord"},{"c":"وَانْحَرْ","d":"wa-in'ḥar","e":"and sacrifice"}],"a":{"g":"So pray to your Lord and sacrifice [to Him alone]."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"شَانِئَكَ","d":"shāni-aka","e":"your enemy"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"he (is)"},{"c":"الْأَبْتَرُ","d":"l-abtaru","e":"the one cut off"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off."}}}